            "review_text": "Warren H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam308 contributions\n2\nService so slow I didn’t even eat\nAug 2019 • Solo\nI read some fantastic comments about their burgers recently and thought I would give them a try. I went Sunday at 625pm and when i ordered I told the guy I need it to be quick as I have to be somewhere at 7. There was only 2 others who looked like they ordered just before me. I waited , mentioned once I was in a hurry, and when I saw them serving the other 2 at 645 thought ok but of a rush but I had 10 minutes to eat. After a few minutes and no food I went up to the counter again and saw that he was about to START cooking my order. I got angry and said I can’t wait any more. I ordered at 625 in a burger shop and you don’t start cooking until 648 and I told you a few times I needed to be gone by 7. I demanded my money back and left. Big problem was I took an antibiotic on the way there which was meant to be taken with food and they could not achieve that. I went to my 7pm appointment and felt nauseous until I was finally able to eat at 9pm. Worst service I have experienced for some time and shame as I won’t get to try what others suggest are the best burgers around. The excuse was being unable to cope with all orders. Remember only 3 people there. Terrible indeed. If you want to try make sure there is no one else there or be prepared to wait and wait\nRead more\nWritten August 19, 2019",
