            "review_title": "Review at Surf Shack Saigon",
            "review_text": "Maria Labrosse L\nManchester, United Kingdom2 contributions\n0\nBest burgers in Ho Chi Minh\nJul 2019 • Couples\nWe visited last night and enjoyed the food so much. The burgers are 100% the best we have had in Ho Chi Minh so far and one of the best (and best value) meals in Thao Dien. The meat was juicy, ingredients were fresh, chips were great, price was great and it was quick service despite there being only one guy working last night. I got the Surf Shack burger (extra ingredients are very cheap too if you want something extra) and my boyfriend got the double double, both were really tasty and well seasoned. The member of staff working there was really nice too. Will definitely be returning!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 5, 2019",
