            "review_text": "Vietpete2014\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nGreat food, great Staff and great prices\nApr 2018 • Family\nIf you like Burgers, Sandwiches, Omelettes and the like, this is the place to come. The Venue is compact but nicely decorated and spotlessly clean. The Menu is very extensive and different from the norm. The food was unanimously declared delicious, with lots of ingredients which just shouted freshness, and the fries are superb. As a bonus its possible to buy a Skateboard too ! Staff are lovely.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 19, 2018",
